{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n  <body>\n    <img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/WhatsApp-Image-2026-05-08-at-09.25.08-1-696x1024.jpeg\">\n    <p>劉輔國曾任職房屋署，曾為房署的總建築師，在 2022 年獲擢升為房屋署助理署長。</p>\n    <img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/lau-1024x699.jpeg\">\n    <p>劉輔國曾任職房屋署，曾為房署的總建築師，在 2022 年獲擢升為房屋署助理署長。</p>\n    <img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/WhatsApp-Image-2026-05-08-at-09.25.31-1-1024x796.jpeg\">\n    <p>民政事務總署副署長易志宏是市區重建局的非執董。</p>\n    <img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/0N5A7684-1024x683.jpeg\">\n    <img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/0N5A7844-1024x683.jpeg\">\n    <img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/0N5A7827-1024x683.jpeg\">\n    <img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/0N5A7910-1024x683.jpeg\">\n    <img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/0N5A7715-1024x683.jpeg\">\n    <img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/0N5A7660-1024x683.jpeg\">\n    <img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Payme-500x237.png\">\n  </body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-08T02:03:20.619936+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":105,"images":10,"source":"The Collective HK","fallback":"none"}}